      "heading": "Overview",
      "level": 1,
      "paragraphs": [
        "This is an outpost entry. For information on the explorable area, see Domain of Anguish. For information on the mission, see The Ebony Citadel of Mallyx.",
        "Gate of Anguish Campaign Nightfall Region Realm of Torment Type Mission outpost Party size 8 Exit(s) Chantry of SecretsCity of Torc'quaRavenheart GloomStygian VeilThe Foundry of Failed Creations Images Map A view inside",
        "The Gate of Anguish is the staging area where the remnant forces of Abaddon retreated to after his defeat at the hands of the Order of the Sunspears. It is filled with what appears to be the remains of dead insectoid gods used to line the back of giant torsos that appear to be from the Domain of Pain."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Getting there",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "This outpost can only be reached after completion of Guild Wars Nightfall campaign (that is, the Abaddon's Gate mission).",
        "Go to the Chantry of Secrets and talk to the Guardian of Whispers to enter the small gated area. In there, /kneel before the statue of the Goddess of Truth and talk to the Seer of Truth that appears.",
        "After entering Gate of Anguish in this way, it becomes available as a mission outpost on the Realm of Torment map."
      ]
    },
