  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_icon.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Disambig icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/19px-Disambig_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/29px-Disambig_icon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/67/Disambig_icon.png/38px-Disambig_icon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"225\" data-file-height=\"190\" /></a> <i>This is an <a href=\"/wiki/Outpost\" title=\"Outpost\">outpost</a> entry. For information on the <a href=\"/wiki/Explorable_area\" title=\"Explorable area\">explorable area</a>, see <a href=\"/wiki/Domain_of_Anguish\" title=\"Domain of Anguish\">Domain of Anguish</a>.  For information on the <a href=\"/wiki/Mission\" title=\"Mission\">mission</a>, see <a href=\"/wiki/The_Ebony_Citadel_of_Mallyx\" title=\"The Ebony Citadel of Mallyx\">The Ebony Citadel of Mallyx</a>.   </i></dd></dl></div>\n<table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\" class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Gate of Anguish\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gate_of_Anguish.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Gate of Anguish.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/4e/Gate_of_Anguish.jpg/196px-Gate_of_Anguish.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" srcset=\"/images/4/4e/Gate_of_Anguish.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Region</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Realm of Torment</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mission_outpost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mission outpost\">Mission outpost</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">Party</a> size\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#BAE;\">Exit(s)\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Chantry_of_Secrets\" title=\"Chantry of Secrets\">Chantry of Secrets</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/City_of_Torc%27qua\" title=\"City of Torc&#39;qua\">City of Torc'qua</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Ravenheart_Gloom\" title=\"Ravenheart Gloom\">Ravenheart Gloom</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Stygian_Veil\" title=\"Stygian Veil\">Stygian Veil</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/The_Foundry_of_Failed_Creations\" title=\"The Foundry of Failed Creations\">The Foundry of Failed Creations</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#BAE;\">Images\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gate_of_Anguish_(map).jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Gate of Anguish (map).jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/f/f5/Gate_of_Anguish_%28map%29.jpg/196px-Gate_of_Anguish_%28map%29.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"179\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f5/Gate_of_Anguish_%28map%29.jpg/294px-Gate_of_Anguish_%28map%29.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f5/Gate_of_Anguish_%28map%29.jpg/392px-Gate_of_Anguish_%28map%29.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"772\" data-file-height=\"706\" /></a><br /><small>Map</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gate_of_Anguish_inside.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Gate of Anguish inside.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/0/0f/Gate_of_Anguish_inside.jpg/196px-Gate_of_Anguish_inside.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"157\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/0f/Gate_of_Anguish_inside.jpg/294px-Gate_of_Anguish_inside.jpg 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/0f/Gate_of_Anguish_inside.jpg/392px-Gate_of_Anguish_inside.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"800\" /></a><br /><small>A view inside</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>A tiny shred of reality clinging to <a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon\" title=\"Abaddon\">Abaddon</a>'s former realm, the Gate of Anguish leads to a domain of unimaginable sorrow and despair. It is here that the evil lord <a href=\"/wiki/Mallyx_the_Unyielding\" title=\"Mallyx the Unyielding\">Mallyx the Unyielding</a> builds his bastion of power, which threatens the very existence of the <a href=\"/wiki/Goddess_of_Truth\" title=\"Goddess of Truth\">Goddess of Truth</a>.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— in-game description</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote style=\"font-style: italic; padding: 0em 2em 0em 1em; margin: 1em 0em 1em 4em; border-left: 1px solid #DDD;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; margin-top: -0.2em; margin-left: -0.8em; font: bold 5em Times New Roman, Times, Georgie, serif; color: #EEE;\">“</div>\n<p>The Gate of Anguish is one of the great locks erected by the five gods to imprison Abaddon. Located on the first layer of the Realm of Torment, the lock was sundered when Varesh performed her unholy ceremony at the Temple of Lyssa in Vabbi, allowing the fallen lord to coalesce part of his godform and gain much greater control over his prison. Past the gate lies a whirpool of darkness.\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 0.9em;\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Gw.dat\" title=\"Gw.dat\">gw.dat</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Gate of Anguish</a> is the staging area where the remnant forces of Abaddon retreated to after his defeat at the hands of the <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_the_Sunspears\" title=\"Order of the Sunspears\">Order of the Sunspears</a>. It is filled with what appears to be <a href=\"/wiki/Harvestman%27s_Lair\" title=\"Harvestman&#39;s Lair\">the remains of dead insectoid gods</a> used to line the back of giant torsos that appear to be from the <a href=\"/wiki/Domain_of_Pain\" title=\"Domain of Pain\">Domain of Pain</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Getting_there\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Getting there</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Quests_available\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests available</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Services\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Services</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Getting_there\">Getting there</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Getting there\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This outpost can only be reached after completion of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Wars_Nightfall\" title=\"Guild Wars Nightfall\">Guild Wars Nightfall</a></i> <a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">campaign</a> (that is, the <a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon%27s_Gate\" title=\"Abaddon&#39;s Gate\">Abaddon's Gate</a> mission).\n</p><p>Go to the <a href=\"/wiki/Chantry_of_Secrets\" title=\"Chantry of Secrets\">Chantry of Secrets</a> and talk to the <a href=\"/wiki/Guardian_of_Whispers\" title=\"Guardian of Whispers\">Guardian of Whispers</a> to enter the small gated area. In there, /<a href=\"/wiki/Emote\" title=\"Emote\">kneel</a> before the statue of the <a href=\"/wiki/Goddess_of_Truth\" title=\"Goddess of Truth\">Goddess of Truth</a> and talk to the <a href=\"/wiki/Seer_of_Truth\" title=\"Seer of Truth\">Seer of Truth</a> that appears.\n</p><p>After entering Gate of Anguish in this way, it becomes available as a mission outpost on the <a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Realm of Torment</a> map.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests_available\">Quests available</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Quests available\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Chaplain_Phyratyss\" title=\"Chaplain Phyratyss\">Chaplain Phyratyss</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Finding_a_Purpose\" title=\"Finding a Purpose\">Finding a Purpose</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/High_Priest_Zhellix\" title=\"High Priest Zhellix\">High Priest Zhellix</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mallyx_the_Unyielding_(quest)\" title=\"Mallyx the Unyielding (quest)\">Mallyx the Unyielding</a> (Difficulty: Master) <img alt=\"Repeatable quest\" src=\"/images/c/c6/Tango-quest-icon-repeatable.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"Repeatable quest\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Mesmer\"><img alt=\"Mesmer\" src=\"/images/f/fb/Mesmer-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/High_Priest_Zhellix\" title=\"High Priest Zhellix\">High Priest Zhellix</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Aurus_Trevess\" title=\"Aurus Trevess\">Aurus Trevess</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Chaplain_Phyratyss\" title=\"Chaplain Phyratyss\">Chaplain Phyratyss</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Raukus\" title=\"Raukus\">Raukus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Runahs_Silus\" title=\"Runahs Silus\">Runahs Silus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Virashak\" title=\"Virashak\">Virashak</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Services\">Services</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Services\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Armorsmith_of_Whispers\" title=\"Armorsmith of Whispers\">Armorsmith of Whispers</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Hero_armorer\" title=\"Hero armorer\">hero armorer</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Dahn\" title=\"Dahn\">Dahn</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Merchant\" title=\"Merchant\">merchant</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Deacon_of_Whispers\" title=\"Deacon of Whispers\">Deacon of Whispers</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Collector\" title=\"Collector\">collector</a> for 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Armbrace_of_Truth\" title=\"Armbrace of Truth\">Armbrace of Truth</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Keeper_of_Whispers\" title=\"Keeper of Whispers\">Keeper of Whispers</a> (collector for a set of <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Domain_of_Anguish_gemstones\" title=\"Category:Domain of Anguish gemstones\">Domain of Anguish gemstones</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 24 <a href=\"/wiki/Xunlai_Chest\" title=\"Xunlai Chest\">Xunlai Chest</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Storage\">storage</a>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gate_of_Anguish&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>There are no <a href=\"/wiki/Henchmen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Henchmen\">henchmen</a> services here, since they cannot be taken into the elite <a href=\"/wiki/Explorable_area\" title=\"Explorable area\">explorable areas</a>. You are still able to take <a href=\"/wiki/Hero\" title=\"Hero\">heroes</a>, though.</li></ul>\n<hr style=\"margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; clear:both;\" />\n<table style=\"border:1px solid silver; font-size:90%; width:90%; text-align:center; clear:both;\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#BAE; font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment#Towns_and_outposts\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Towns and outposts in the Realm of Torment</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Torment\" title=\"Gate of Torment\">Gate of Torment</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon%27s_Gate_(outpost)\" title=\"Abaddon&#39;s Gate (outpost)\">Abaddon's Gate</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Gate of Anguish</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Fear\" title=\"Gate of Fear\">Gate of Fear</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Madness_(outpost)\" title=\"Gate of Madness (outpost)\">Gate of Madness</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Pain_(outpost)\" title=\"Gate of Pain (outpost)\">Gate of Pain</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_Secrets\" title=\"Gate of Secrets\">Gate of Secrets</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gate_of_the_Nightfallen_Lands\" title=\"Gate of the Nightfallen Lands\">Gate of the Nightfallen Lands</a> •</span> <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow_Nexus_(outpost)\" title=\"The Shadow Nexus (outpost)\">The Shadow Nexus</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment#Missions\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Missions</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment#Explorable_areas\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Explorable areas</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment#Landmarks\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Landmarks</a></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009130051\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU ti